* text=auto
*.php text eol=lf
*.md  text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.cc  text eol=lf
*.h   text eol=lf
*.sh  text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ini text eol=crlf
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.lib binary
# 证书包（`assets/cacert.pem`）：行尾不许被转换 —— 它是 curl 的信任根，
# 而 `* text=auto` 会在 Windows 检出时把 LF 换成 CRLF（OpenSSL 能读，但 diff 全红）
*.pem binary
